Phishing Awareness
Recognise suspicious emails : be careful of unexpected emails requesting personal or confidential information.
Identify fake links : check links carefully before clicking on them.
Verify the sender : confirm the identity of anyone requesting sensitive account information.
Report suspicious message : inform the IT or security department about suspected phishing attempts.
Phishing prevention 
Use strong passwords : Create unique and difficult to guess passwords for each account.
Enable multi factor authentication : Add an extra layer of security when logging into accounts.
Install antivirus software : use updated security software to detect and block malicious files.
Use email filtering : apply spam filters to identify and block suspicious emails.
